@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 22
top to bottom direction
component "FastAPI / Jinja\nGET /, /search, /documents/{id}" as Web
component "POST /chat\napp/api/routes.py" as Chat
component "run_advanced_rag\napp/services/rag_pipeline.py" as Pipeline
component "Legacy hybrid\nLegalRetriever" as Legacy
component "V3 retrieval\nVertexQdrantRetriever" as V3
component "V3 article expansion\nsource + content hash check" as Expand
component "Bounded context\n≤ 3 passages / 720 tokens" as Context
component "LLM generation" as Generate
component "Input / output checks\nconfigurable guardrails" as Guard
 database "Cache + interaction store" as State
Web --> Chat
Chat --> Guard : input check
Chat --> State : cache lookup
Chat --> Pipeline : cache miss
Pipeline --> Legacy : USE_LEGACY_FREE_PIPELINE = true
Pipeline --> V3 : USE_LEGACY_FREE_PIPELINE = false (default)
V3 --> Expand : optional evidence expansion
Legacy --> Context
Expand --> Context
Legacy --> Context
Context --> Generate
Generate --> Guard : output check
Guard --> State : persist status and trace
note bottom of V3
Vertex embedding 1024d + Qdrant v3;
RRF / DBSF rank blend.
Observed capacity snapshot is partial,
not full corpus coverage.
end note
note bottom of Legacy
Qdrant E5 384d + Pinecone v1;
SQLite FTS for number/title and local
content resolution. No silent cross-fallback.
end note
@enduml



